sequenceDiagram
    participant LLM as Agent Orchestrator
    participant Gate as Execution Gate Middleware
    participant Repo as Deterministic Repository
    participant Handler as Rollback Handler

    LLM->>Gate: Propose Code Execution (Patch)
    Gate->>Gate: Check Admissibility Pipeline
    
    alt is patching previous patch (Context Rot)
        Gate-->>LLM: Throw Exception (Action Blocked)
        Gate->>Gate: Increment Failure Counter
        
        alt Failure Counter > Threshold
            Gate->>Handler: Trigger Governance Halt
            Handler->>Repo: Execute Hard Reset
            Handler->>Repo: git clean -fd
            Handler-->>LLM: Terminate Session (Semantic Reset Required)
        end
    else is admissible
        Gate->>Repo: Allow Execution
        Repo-->>Gate: Execution Success
        Gate->>Gate: Reset Failure Counter
        Gate-->>LLM: Proceed to next step
    end
